title: "QRC-ADMET matched evaluation"
abstract: "Code and locked results for a matched evaluation of fixed five-qubit quantum reservoir residuals on 22 TDC ADMET endpoints, including finite-shot, circuit-level Aer noise, source-dependence, and continuous external-regression analyses."
